// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`[UC8] status --compare on a seeded set of recorded decisions > renders the per-profile table (snapshot) 1`] = `
"Dispatch status --compare (all recorded decisions)
Real decisions: 20. All figures are ESTIMATED from recorded decision snapshots.

profile   tasks  delegated  host  reject  fallback  fell-through  rel.cost
balance*     20         16     3       1        16             4        48
preserve     20         16     3       1         0           n/a        60

Per instance (planned delegations, estimated relative cost):
  balance: codex x16 (cost 48)
  preserve: claude-alt x4 (cost 12), codex x16 (cost 48)

* = profile that was active for some of these decisions (the real routing)
n/a = profile never ran for real, so fall-throughs cannot be observed
Host consumption: not observable
"
`;
